                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Freakins' biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Gen-Z female fashion focus + Instagram + Reels native + high cadence + real-women marketing. Multi-dimensional advantage in demographic previously under-served.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new Gen-Z fashion brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in niching (specific aesthetic focus, sustainable Gen-Z, regional-language Gen-Z content). Category continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>Should new fashion brands focus Gen-Z?</h3>
                                        <p>Depends. Gen-Z is trendy + high-cadence-demanding + lower-AOV. Established millennial + Gen-X + luxury remain viable different markets.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest Gen-Z fashion lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Instagram + Reels native + high cadence + authenticity + real-women representation combined. Aspirational-legacy fashion playbook fails with Gen-Z.</p>
